@startuml UC4_Select_Cities_Activity_Diagram

title UC4: Select Cities - Activity Diagram

start
:System displays city selection interface
with currently selected cities;
:User searches for cities by name or location;
:System calls external City API;

if (API responds?) then (yes)
  :System retrieves matching cities from API;
else (no - timeout/unavailable)
  :System retries API call once;
  if (API responds on retry?) then (yes)
    :System retrieves matching cities from API;
  else (no)
    :System uses cached city database;
    :System displays limited results with warning;
  endif
endif

if (Cities found?) then (yes)
  :System displays matching cities;
else (no)
  :System displays "No results" message;
  :User can refine search criteria;
endif

:User selects cities to add;

if (User wants to delete cities?) then (yes)
  :User selects city to remove;
  :System removes city from selection;
endif

:User confirms selection;
:System validates that at least one city remains selected;

if (At least one city selected?) then (yes)
  :System saves updated city preferences;
  stop
else (no)
  :System displays error;
  :User returns to search/select;
endif

@enduml
